{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "cbc6f13665e1dba28b53a5106ebffbcb551f708a2d1659651773738012094320", "ja": "根性のミニチョコ千本ノック！", "zh": "毅力的小巧克力千球接杀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dea1d250399d01b8bf09ecea713326cea6970a9479691750ef6b674bf2eed964", "ja": "イメトレ中の紗代子は、大量のミニチョコ\n全てに本気で向き合いたいと熱意をみせる。\n感化された未来と杏奈もイメトレを開始！\n会場のお客さん全員に真心を伝えるため……\nミニチョコ千本ノック、行きますッ！！！", "zh": "正在进行想象训练的纱代子，展现出想认真面对大量迷你巧克力的热情。\n受到感染的未来和杏奈也开始进行想象训练！\n为了把真心传达给会场的所有客人……\n迷你巧克力千本击球训练，开始！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2fdf74b1cb2c86b2548edfdea3587e4b3039a4329afa294cde96e58e36fa0c17", "ja": "（どこからか、数を数える声が聞こえてくる。\nこの声は……紗代子か）", "zh": "（不知从哪里传来数数的声音。这声音是……纱代子吗。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "e0089f6876d144eb28c7c54843542cf686a51a49579d6faed937edd4766773bb", "ja": "98個、99個……100個！　ふぅ、目標達成！\nよーし、次はもう100個追加して……。", "zh": "98个、99个……100个！呼，达成目标！\n好——接下来再追加100个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "c015a4234b85662e7bce9d5adc89769f9f52b431338f9e156ad8fb1a658e256a", "ja": "紗代子ちゃん、何してるの～？", "zh": "纱代子，你在做什么呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "b4828bfddc2615ec3c50cd3ffeacd0a88bc82abba11c6e4ae08810d3e9780175", "ja": "あっ、未来ちゃん。あのね、チョコレートに\n気持ちを込めるイメージトレーニングだよ！", "zh": "啊，未来。我跟你说哦，我正在做把心意\n倾注进巧克力里的意象训练呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "0706a795325f229ece8860c593e21f8243461c74318f2a491a5bd0e5c7db73ba", "ja": "イメトレ？　紗代子さん、\nチョコレートに気持ちをこめるの？", "zh": "想象训练？纱代子，  \n要把心意注入巧克力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "dcfc33c386b7708c0db00397b615c52a9b53b7938aec1835b39e874f16999d9a", "ja": "うん！　私たちのチームは大量のチョコを作るから、\n本気で向き合うなら、スピード勝負になると思って。", "zh": "嗯！因为我们队要制作大量巧克力，\n所以如果要认真对待，就得和速度赛跑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "b4ea56dd2140e809514b9dbf87ae54a80c8deeacc5cb04a8a8572034db061a70", "ja": "でも、適当になんてしたくないから。\n全部のチョコに、私たちの想いを込めたいなって！", "zh": "可是，我不想随随便便地应付。想把我们的心意融入每一块巧克力里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "207fa4d525edf9de794e435123f63277d1dee879634cb03e1ec27c474bf69034", "ja": "わぁ～！　すごいね、紗代子ちゃん！\n私も、自分のチョコに想い込めてみたい！", "zh": "哇～！好厉害啊，纱代子！\n我也想试着把自己的心意融入巧克力里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "21cff6d4ce9805613f43e7a59cbae3709686e929d6aef91756a1cd56927b528b", "ja": "杏奈たちは、たくさん作らないけど。イメトレ、\nいっしょにやりたい！　紗代子さん、やらせて！", "zh": "杏奈她们不会做很多，不过想一起做想象练习！纱代子，让我来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "faa353ee26863ff886b8814da982a23cece653d5c2dd09f5553a6c8513306628", "ja": "じゃあみんな、行くよ！\n101個、102個、103個、104個……。", "zh": "那么大家，开始啦！\n101个、102个、103个、104个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ee82e3d1664fd167ba7aa9110270f8ddc3027487bc3f1e38b6e885506ecaa718", "ja": "（未来と杏奈も一緒に……真剣にやっているようだし、\n声はかけないでおくか）", "zh": "（未来和杏奈也在一起……看起来正认真地做着，还是别出声打扰她们了吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
